<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jiankang-shilu" book-id="b-jiankang-shilu-001" chapter-id="c-jiankang-shilu-001-lingtong-wu055" source-id="s-jiankang-shilu-001-lingtong-wu055">
  <p id="c-jiankang-shilu-001-lingtong-wu055:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">是歲，偏將軍、都亭侯<persName id="c-jiankang-shilu-001-lingtong-wu055:p001:m0010" ref="evj_nj4_5k4">凌統</persName>卒。</p>
  <p id="c-jiankang-shilu-001-lingtong-wu055:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jiankang-shilu-001-lingtong-wu055:p002:m0000" ref="evj_nj4_5k4">統</persName>為人性好接物，親賢愛士，輕財重義，有國士風。年二十九卒。<persName id="c-jiankang-shilu-001-lingtong-wu055:p002:m0029" ref="572_278_cba">權</persName>聞之驚起，哀不自勝，使<persName id="c-jiankang-shilu-001-lingtong-wu055:p002:m0041" ref="roi_rz4_ute_B">張承</persName>作誄致祭。</p>
  <p id="c-jiankang-shilu-001-lingtong-wu055:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">有二子<persName id="c-jiankang-shilu-001-lingtong-wu055:p003:m0003" ref="evj_nj4_5k4_A">烈</persName>、<persName id="c-jiankang-shilu-001-lingtong-wu055:p003:m0005" ref="evj_nj4_5k4_B">封</persName>，</p>
  <p id="c-jiankang-shilu-001-lingtong-wu055:p004" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">皆幼弱，<persName id="c-jiankang-shilu-001-lingtong-wu055:p004:m0004" ref="572_278_cba">權</persName>收養於宮中。年八九歲，令<persName id="c-jiankang-shilu-001-lingtong-wu055:p004:m0017" ref="gtm_9n8_vkm">葛先</persName>授書，</p>
</text>
